Apply the firewall from `[bootstrap.linux.firewall]`
.PP
\fBUsage:\fR mise bootstrap firewall apply [OPTIONS]
.PP
\fBOptions:\fR
.PP
.TP
\fB\-n, \-\-dry\-run\fR
Show what would change without changing anything
.TP
\fB\-y, \-\-yes\fR
Skip the confirmation prompt
.TP
